    "answer": {
      "short": "$15\\text{ cm}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}558&=2(5x\\times2x)+2(3x\\times2x)+2(5x\\times3x)\\\\558&=20x^2+12x^2+30x^2\\\\558&=62x^2\\\\x^2&=9\\\\x&=3\\end{align*}$$\nThe longest edge is $5x=5(3)=15\\text{ cm}$.",
